preprocessor = ColumnTransformer(
    transformers=[
        (
            "numerical",
            numerical_pipeline,
            numerical_features
        ),
        (
            "categorical",
            categorical_pipeline,
            categorical_features
        )
    ],
    remainder="drop"
)

Create the model:

model = RandomForestClassifier(
    n_estimators=300,
    min_samples_split=5,
    min_samples_leaf=2,
    class_weight="balanced",
    random_state=RANDOM_STATE,
    n_jobs=-1
)

Combine everything:

model_pipeline = Pipeline(
    steps=[
        ("preprocessor", preprocessor),
        ("model", model)
    ]
)

print(model_pipeline)

This is the main reusable machine-learning pipeline.

